# One SIP identity per line. Never commit real credentials.
# Deutsche Telekom example (replace the placeholders):
"My number" <sip:+49XXXXXXXXXX@tel.t-online.de>;regint=300;outbound="sip:tel.t-online.de";stunserver=stun:stun.t-online.de;mediaenc=srtp-mand

# Additional numbers go on additional lines.
# "Second number" <sip:+49YYYYYYYYYY@tel.t-online.de>;regint=300;outbound="sip:tel.t-online.de";stunserver=stun:stun.t-online.de;mediaenc=srtp-mand
